        "medium": "PUBLISHER_BIBLIOGRAPHY_AND_CARD_CITATION_POINTER_ONLY",
        "reference": "PMID:23800600",
        "url": "https://www.microbiologyresearch.org/content/journal/jmm/10.1099/jmm.0.062661-0"
      },
      "qnrvc2": {
        "assessment": "The source distinguishes QnrVC1 in VC627 from QnrVC2 identified in silico in a previously deposited Vibrio cholerae O1 sequence from Vietnam. The measured phenotype described for VC627 is not a QnrVC2-specific result. AB200915 is a deposition accession, not a genome assembly or BioSample. This scoped distinction is not a universal claim that QnrVC2 lacks activity.",
